+
+- **Severity**: Low
+- **File:line**: `public/js/suite/roll-v2.js:1061-1064`
+- **Triggering input or sequence**: Any POST fails because of schema drift, authorization/session drift, a route deployment mismatch, database failure, or a network error. `_logRoll()` attaches a completely empty rejection handler.
+- **Observable consequence**: Player rolling remains responsive, but every persisted-history write can fail indefinitely with no player signal, developer console warning, telemetry hook, or operator-visible indication from this call site. A broken feature can therefore look healthy until someone manually audits the feed/database.
