## Validation notes

### Ship assessment

**Blocking problem — not ready to ship as-is.** At minimum, the client/schema boundary must be made compatible for all three real branches (including `state.NA`/`again_rule` semantics and exploded dice), an integration test must exercise values produced by the real roller rather than hand-shaped fixtures, and roll-log WS delivery must enforce the intended ST/dev read boundary. The feed race/reconnect, spend durability, attribution race, and validation-limit findings also need disposition.

### Pass boundaries and files opened

- **Pass 1**: Opened only `specs/stories/code-review/gdx-8-roll-history-diff.txt`, then created this report and froze the Pass 1 findings. No repository source or story/spec file was opened.
