### Modification attestation

No source, test, schema, route, CSS, HTML, story, sprint, concurrent Allies→Sway file, or sibling repository was edited by this review. The only intended filesystem write was this findings report. No temporary proof edit was made. Two full-suite child processes created by this review were stopped after the timeout; no pre-existing processes were touched. Final `git status --short` still shows the expected 13 story files dirty/untracked plus unrelated concurrent work (including Allies→Sway and later `deferred-work.md`/tracking changes); `git diff --check` is clean for all 13 story files. The report was concurrently altered multiple times, as disclosed above; I preserved rather than erased that content.


